WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.500
Let’s add your Sunday School lesson to the portal.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.950
Open Lessons and switch from Calendar to List.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.600
Select I teach to find your upcoming lessons.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.950
Check the date, then choose Edit lesson.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.750
Give your lesson a clear title.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.400
Choose Add link and name your resource.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.600
Paste a share link with the right access permissions.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.300
Add any other resources, like a worksheet or a video.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:39.150
Then select Save lesson.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:44.300
Your lesson and resources are now available on the portal.
